{"version":"1.0","built":"2026-10-01","lessons":[{"id":"l1","title":"第 1 課 · 后翼接受棄兵 QGA(2…dxc4)","goal":"知道「棄兵」其實拿得回來;不要為了守兵而犧牲發展。","ideas":["白方 e3 + Bxc4 輕鬆把兵吃回來,同時完成發展。","黑方最常見的錯誤:用 …b5 硬守 c4 兵 → a4! 拆掉兵鏈。","3.e4 直接佔中心是較積極的選擇,但要小心 …e5 的反擊。"],"lines":[{"name":"主線:3.Nf3 + e3 吃回兵","side":"w","notes":{"4":"黑方吃兵。這不是真的棄兵——白方幾乎一定能拿回來。","5":"先出馬,阻止 …e5。","7":"打開 f1 象的線路,準備 Bxc4。","9":"兵拿回來了,而且象已經出動 → 白方發展領先。","10":"黑方標準反擊:攻擊 d4 中心。","12":"…a6 準備 …b5 搶空間。白方常見計畫:Qe2、Rd1、dxc5 或 e4 推進。"},"plan":["白:Qe2 + Rd1,中線施壓;時機成熟推 e4 或 d5。","黑:…b5、…Bb7、…Nbd7、…Qc7,活躍后翼。"],"plies":[{"fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/8/8/PPPPPPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 1"},{"san":"d4","from":"d2","to":"d4","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/3P4/8/PPP1PPPP/RNBQKBNR b KQkq d3 0 1"},{"san":"d5","from":"d7","to":"d5","fen":"rnbqkbnr/ppp1pppp/8/3p4/3P4/8/PPP1PPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq d6 0 2"},{"san":"c4","from":"c2","to":"c4","fen":"rnbqkbnr/ppp1pppp/8/3p4/2PP4/8/PP2PPPP/RNBQKBNR b KQkq c3 0 2"},{"san":"dxc4","from":"d5","to":"c4","fen":"rnbqkbnr/ppp1pppp/8/8/2pP4/8/PP2PPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 3"},{"san":"Nf3","from":"g1","to":"f3","fen":"rnbqkbnr/ppp1pppp/8/8/2pP4/5N2/PP2PPPP/RNBQKB1R b KQkq - 1 3"},{"san":"Nf6","from":"g8","to":"f6","fen":"rnbqkb1r/ppp1pppp/5n2/8/2pP4/5N2/PP2PPPP/RNBQKB1R w KQkq - 2 4"},{"san":"e3","from":"e2","to":"e3","fen":"rnbqkb1r/ppp1pppp/5n2/8/2pP4/4PN2/PP3PPP/RNBQKB1R b KQkq - 0 4"},{"san":"e6","from":"e7","to":"e6","fen":"rnbqkb1r/ppp2ppp/4pn2/8/2pP4/4PN2/PP3PPP/RNBQKB1R w KQkq - 0 5"},{"san":"Bxc4","from":"f1","to":"c4","fen":"rnbqkb1r/ppp2ppp/4pn2/8/2BP4/4PN2/PP3PPP/RNBQK2R b KQkq - 0 5"},{"san":"c5","from":"c7","to":"c5","fen":"rnbqkb1r/pp3ppp/4pn2/2p5/2BP4/4PN2/PP3PPP/RNBQK2R w KQkq c6 0 6"},{"san":"O-O","from":"e1","to":"g1","fen":"rnbqkb1r/pp3ppp/4pn2/2p5/2BP4/4PN2/PP3PPP/RNBQ1RK1 b kq - 1 6"},{"san":"a6","from":"a7","to":"a6","fen":"rnbqkb1r/1p3ppp/p3pn2/2p5/2BP4/4PN2/PP3PPP/RNBQ1RK1 w kq - 0 7"}]},{"name":"陷阱:黑方 …b5 硬守兵","side":"w","trap":true,"notes":{"6":"1000–1500 分段超常見!黑想守住多的兵。","7":"立刻攻擊兵鏈的